<main class="page-content" id="main-content">
<h1 class="sr-only">Jewellery Insurance Specialists in Melbourne and Sydney</h1>
<section class="site-hero" aria-label="Cameron &amp; Co — jewellery insurance specialists">
  <div class="site-hero-photo"></div>
  <div class="site-hero-inner">
    <div class="site-hero-eyebrow">Jewellery Insurance Specialists — Sydney &amp; Melbourne</div>
    <div class="site-hero-line1">What was lost,</div>
    <div class="site-hero-line2">beautifully <span class="accent">restored.</span></div>
    <a class="site-hero-cta" href="{{ pages['booking'].url }}">Book a private consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="bento-heading" class="wix-section home-services-shell"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-eyebrow">What we can do for you</div><h2 class="section-title" id="bento-heading">Remodelling, repairs &amp; replacement</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Working with Australia's major insurers and loss adjusters for over 25 years — current appraisals, trusted replacement, and bespoke remaking, all under one roof.</p><div class="home-hero-grid"><div class="hero-left-col"><div class="hero-card tall"><img alt="Jeweller reshaping a ring at the workbench during a remodelling project" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-jewellery-remodelling-workbench.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Jewellery Remodelling</h2></div><div class="hero-card"><img alt="Laser welding repair on a broken gold chain link" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-jewellery-repair-laser-welding.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Repairs</h2></div></div><div class="hero-right-col"><div class="hero-card"><img alt="Jeweller inspecting a diamond ring under magnification during an appraisal" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'inspecting-diamonds-magnification.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Appraisals</h2></div><div class="hero-card tall"><img alt="New diamond ring boxed ready as an insurance replacement piece" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'single-diamond-ring-box.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Jewellery Replacement</h2></div></div></div></div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="services-heading" class="wix-section what-we-do-section"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-eyebrow">What we can do for you</div><h2 class="section-title" id="services-heading">Four ways we help</h2><div class="service-list"><article class="service-item"><span class="service-item-num">01</span><h3>Appraisals</h3><p>By phone, in our showroom, or at your home or workplace — whatever suits your schedule. Appointments run Monday to Friday, with extended hours available.</p></article><article class="service-item"><span class="service-item-num">02</span><h3>Jewellery Remodelling</h3><p>We take apart the original piece, reuse the gems and metals, and craft a custom, updated design built around how you actually wear it.</p></article><article class="service-item"><span class="service-item-num">03</span><h3>Repairs</h3><p>Regular checks catch wear and tear before it becomes loss. Every visit includes a complimentary ring clean and inspection.</p></article><article class="service-item"><span class="service-item-num">04</span><h3>Jewellery Replacement</h3><p>Once your insurer establishes a replacement value, choose from stock, special order, or a piece individually designed and handcrafted in our workshop.</p></article></div><div class="btn-row-center home-chat-button-row"><a class="home-button home-button-dark" href="{{ pages['contact'].url }}">Chat to us</a></div></div><img alt="Stack of gold and silver bezel-set gemstone rings" class="what-we-do-rings" height="369" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-coloured-gemstone-bezel-rings.webp' | asset_url }}" width="236"/></section>
<section aria-label="Partner brands" class="logos-strip"><h2 class="section-title brands-title">Our Brands</h2><div class="logos-track-wrap"><div aria-hidden="true" class="logos-track"><img alt="Ikecho Pearls" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ikecho-pearls-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ice Watch" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ice-watch-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Citizen Watches" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'citizen-watches-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Classique Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'classique-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Burberry" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'burberry-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Fossil" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'fossil-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Dora International" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'dora-international-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Georgini Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'georgini-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Thomas Sabo" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'thomas-sabo-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Peter W Beck" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'peter-w-beck-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ikecho Pearls" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ikecho-pearls-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ice Watch" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ice-watch-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Citizen Watches" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'citizen-watches-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Classique Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'classique-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Burberry" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'burberry-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Fossil" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'fossil-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/></div></div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading" class="home-testimonials-preview wix-section"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-eyebrow">What others have to say</div><h2 class="section-title" id="testimonials-heading">Client stories</h2><div class="home-testimonials-list"><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Roslyn</h3><p>Many thanks for your excellent service in providing a replacement diamond for my Insurance Claim. I am thrilled with the result and will recommend your service to others if the occasion arises.</p></article><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Marina</h3><p>Just confirming that I received rings today. They are absolutely gorgeous. Many thanks for your patience, kind attention to detail and for making a terrible situation, under the circumstances, very special.</p></article><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Cate</h3><p>Tracey, April and the team did a fantastic job replacing my wedding ring. From sourcing an outstanding stone, developing the design, to crafting the final piece, I always felt like I was in the best hands possible.</p></article></div><div class="btn-row-center home-testimonials-button-row"><a class="home-button home-button-dark" href="{{ pages['testimonials'].url }}">Read more</a></div></div></section>
</main>
